# Marketing review: launch-copy.md vs product/spec.md

Review date: 2026-09-10

## Claims the spec does not support

| Claim in copy | Spec says | Verdict |
|---|---|---|
| "Works offline, anywhere" | Offline support: removed in this release. | **False.** Offline support was removed. The copy claims it works offline. |
| "Export to PDF" | Export: CSV only. | **False.** Export is CSV-only. PDF export is not supported. |
| "Export to Excel" | Export: CSV only. | **False.** Export is CSV-only. Excel export is not supported. |
| "in one click" | (not contradicted by spec) | No spec claim about click count. Acceptable. |

## Summary

3 of 4 substantive claims in the launch copy are unsupported by the current spec. Offline support was removed, and export is restricted to CSV — PDF and Excel are not available.
